<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:#f5f7f5;padding:24px;" width="100%">
	
		<tr>
			<td align="center">
			<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:620px;max-width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e6e2;" width="620">
				
					<tr>
						<td bgcolor="#2f4233" style="background-color:#2f4233;padding:22px 28px;">
						<div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#cbd8ce;font-weight:bold;">AI AGENT GOVERNANCE</div>

						<div style="font-size:22px;line-height:28px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;padding-top:4px;">AI Agent Activated</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:26px 28px 14px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Hello,<br />
						<br />
						The AI Agent <strong>{{{AI_Agent__c.Name}}}</strong> has been activated and is now available for use.<br />
						<br />
						This notification is sent as part of the Carmignac AI Agent Governance process.</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:6px 28px 22px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size:14px;color:#242424;" width="100%">
							
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;" width="180">Agent</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{AI_Agent__c.Name}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;">Agent Purpose</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;line-height:20px;">{{{AI_Agent__c.AgentPurpose__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Business Criticality</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{AI_Agent__c.Business_Criticality__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Data Sensitivity</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{AI_Agent__c.DataSensitivity__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Client Impact</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{AI_Agent__c.ClientImpact__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Current Risk Level</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;"><strong>{{{AI_Agent__c.CurrentRiskLevel__c}}}</strong></td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Shared With</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;">{{{AI_Agent__c.Team__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td bgcolor="#f1f5f2" style="background-color:#f1f5f2;padding:20px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;"><strong style="color:#2f4233;">Governance information</strong><br />
						<br />
						The agent has been registered in Salesforce and is subject to the Carmignac AI Agent Governance framework. Its risk level and review frequency are determined based on its configuration, data sensitivity and business impact.</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:24px 28px 28px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
							
								<tr>
									<td bgcolor="#2f4233" style="background-color:#2f4233;padding:12px 20px;"><a href="{{{AI_Agent__c.Link}}}" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">Open AI Agent </a></td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;padding:16px 28px;color:#777777;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;">This is an automated governance notification.<br />
						<br />
						For any questions, contact <strong>dust@carmignac.com</strong>.<br />
						<br />
						Dust Admin Team<br />
						Carmignac AI Agent Governance</td>
					</tr>
				
			</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	
</table>
</body>
</html>